<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces are searching for four soldiers missing after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince while President Bukele has deployed 2,000 Salvadoran troops and denied that his forces carried out airstrikes. Benin has pledged 2,000 troops to assist the fight against gangs and the United Nations reports 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. Haitian gang leaders are seeking UN mediation and have called for dialogue with security forces, while Haiti has graduated 1,189 new officers to bolster anti-gang operations. The postponed presidential election is now set for July 2027 and hunger is worsening as high food prices and El Niño persist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOc0swV0Z5MkJuU21TY0xEaEY5QzdsbUFGLVRwYlBDaDA4Znp1VWpjc1prbUloNTc2U3JVbk02LVRGTzB4X3lSaVppbXJ3RWtLanhkcm9GQkdtU0xFR3ZSMWttdmNFSXNxcVZyeDJxWnlTbUhEU2pHNXNROTlCeXlYcGdjY0prSUs2YWtRVTZOSk00R2Y5WHFHajVZUW9rRWtDbTEwcDNscW9wVkZjUlI0czA2V3k4Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNMFFUS1FvREcwZW95M2FvWm9OdWZkRC00clVUUzhEbG5qS3VtN25sR2s3Z3lPY05rNXZwZ0d1eFdVUldVQldEWGdzQ2RwNWZoQWxKeV8xUXk1czJFYjdhUElRaFlEc1RjMzFjZ28waUhmSl9odjhmc1N3ZHY3TFd4TDFCOG9HY2h3aG4tenZ5QWJQMDFZTW1Zd0x0NFBRNXp2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dominican Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQeWxpdEZWOC1LMmwzSzVnOHoxdjk2TUg2eVNHMG94MkM2d2xfNHhBaFBod2hTNjR0OGhfSnhPeVM3SDdQUzB0OVZKMjk5RTNhTXVfVkNFRFowa0tUUXdSRE1udjR4SGlnelV4ZFY4d2JScXFoWXRNWW1yQUxXZXBkcFFBNzRWSEM4OFdyS29WLVJfcTlXaTVla1FqYmtaWVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;HaitiLibre.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQTkdUdzJ3TU5LenltZk5Tb3RTTG9ORFFxa